{"unit_id":"elementor-i__dsh-agentmemory#card-zh","repo":"elementor-i/dsh-agentmemory","commit":"c91ec7fa45ca3a2dd0b06c723d896f6265270e45","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agentmemory 是把 agentmemory 本地记忆服务接入 DSH 的插件，默认通过工具和后台钩子工作。它向 DSH 注册记忆保存、回忆、搜索、会话查询及其他记忆操作工具，并把会话、提示、工具和子代理活动记录到本地 REST 服务。用户还可选择把召回内容加入系统提示，或手动记一条观察。适合希望跨会话保存项目经验并检索旧决策的 DSH 用户；需要本机运行 agentmemory 服务，密钥为可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:69-97","lib/tools.js:10-35","lib/hooks.js:73-162"]}
{"unit_id":"elementor-i__dsh-agentmemory#card-en","repo":"elementor-i/dsh-agentmemory","commit":"c91ec7fa45ca3a2dd0b06c723d896f6265270e45","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agentmemory connects DSH to a local agentmemory server. It registers tools for saving, recalling, and searching, while hooks record session and tool activity. Optional context injection adds recalled information to the system prompt. A local server is required; a secret is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:69-97","lib/tools.js:10-35","lib/hooks.js:73-162"]}
